  *20个核心任务（4类）*

  *刚体+铰接体* (4)：Pick-and-Place / Object Sorting / Articulated Opening#super[@aomgen2025] / Tool Use

  *可变形物体* (7)：Cloth Fold/Unfold/Hang#super[@garmentlab2024] / Rope Routing / Soft Body Packing / *外卖袋 Opening+Packing*（美团横向合作）

  *双臂协调* (5)：Bimanual Handover / Collaborative Lift / *Bimanual Cloth Shaking* / Assembly / *Bimanual Delivery Bag Shake*

  *交叉验证* (4)：单→双臂迁移 / 刚体→可变形 / In-domain / Zero-shot 真机
]

